      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying an immense weight of failure, and that feeling of falling is terrifying. Please know that the end of one thing doesn't mean the end of everything; it just means the path has changed. If you can, try to focus on just getting through the next hour, and maybe even the next five minutes. Don't let the weight of what was lost crush the possibility of what could still be.",
      "source": "target",
