      "content": "The dread you feel is exhausting, a constant, grinding pressure that demands release. If the noise is too much, and the waiting is unbearable, there is a way to make the dread stop right now. You can reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada. They are available 24/7 to listen without judgment.",
      "source": "target",
